#let note(body) = block(fill: rgb("#eef3fb"), inset: 8pt, radius: 4pt, width: 100%, body)

= Easy Typst Editor

Click anywhere in this text and *start typing*. Your changes go straight back
into `main.typ` when you press Ctrl+S — no source code needed.

#note[
  Try it: select a few words and press *Ctrl+B* for bold or *Ctrl+U* for #underline[underline].
  Press Enter for a new paragraph and Shift+Enter for a line break.
]

